     "head": "Second flavor: slow and fast",
     "say": "The second flavor: slow and fast pointers. Slow w marks where the next kept value goes. The loop is the fast pointer. A new value gets copied to w. One, one, two, two, two, three becomes one, two, three. Same family: three sum, container with most water.",
